{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:workoutTonnageFootnoteOutro", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "workoutTonnageFootnoteOutro", "text": "Exact for what you typed and worthless across exercises — kept out of strain and recovery for that reason.", "sha256": "cee6a1625a4bf190e7f2a36b8460723a4f49307ac7f36d6a3bd5d3cb438e5e4f", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:workoutOverreachHeadline", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "workoutOverreachHeadline", "text": "Your last 7 days of load are {ratio}× your usual six weeks, and your resting heart rate was above your usual on {nightsElevated} of {nightsConsidered} nights.", "sha256": "1c9209186cbea636bbf25db8df1fc612c40fa7a8623263e9b39d1cded425dad5", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:workoutOverreachBody", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "workoutOverreachBody", "text": "Two measurements that happen to point the same way. Illness, travel, altitude, alcohol and a run of poor sleep all produce this same pair, and nothing here can tell them apart.", "sha256": "76ee273a25e3af1b351231c95e29c5242c165e6ef5f9bb538e0020547f96df1f", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:workoutNoLoadTitle", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "workoutNoLoadTitle", "text": "No training load yet", "sha256": "4b155626b6f276c74acf6820cf90586e94e6832f3713dd01b21412f041f06507", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:workoutNoLoadBody", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "workoutNoLoadBody", "text": "Fitness and fatigue are 42-day and 7-day averages. They need about two weeks of sessions.", "sha256": "acb548fbb369485a65d5ef4161d19e1cdbe09e0ff70bf5abd45c95db9216f5d5", "kind": "arb"}
